WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.580
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.720
Check it!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.830
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.910
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.790
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.460
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:41.320
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.530
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:50.230
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.570
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.070
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.380
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.410
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.950
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.390
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.490
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.990
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.500
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.900
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.960
Fly up, angel

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.360
Tokyo festivals ain't too shabby...

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.090
They're not as wild
as in Osaka, though...

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.490
That is that, this is this.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:57.030
You sure got an appetite...

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.510
I can't carry a float,
so I gotta at least eat...

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.680
--Are you hungry?
--Yeah...

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:08.580
--I could go for one of those.
--I'll go buy some!

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.920
It was him! He did it!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:29.770
Hold it!

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:33.440
I didn't do nothin'!

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.670
Yeah right! Your face
looks awful suspicious!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.980
You got it all wrong!

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:40.910
All that weird junk
you're wearin' says otherwise!

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:45.680
--What's going on here?!
--You, there! Face this way!

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:51.090
Me? I'm Hanshin Police
Storm Section 1 Hawk Unit

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:55.990
Independent Special Task Force
Sergeant, Katsu Takane!

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.300
Now for our next story.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.840
Today, a series of random
attacks against women occurred

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.370
at the Asakusa festival.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:10.910
The culprit is still at large,
and his whereabouts are unknown.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.850
If you see someone acting suspiciously,

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:18.310
contact your nearest RAPT Public
Safety Branch Office immediately.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.750
Geez, Tokyo sure is full of clods...

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:27.260
Randomly attacking in the middle
of a festival, talk about mental...

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:31.900
--Don't you agree, Leo-<i>han</i>?
--Sure...

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.960
How long are you planning to stay here?

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:44.300
All that ruckus is over. It's OK
for me to be gone for a while.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:51.220
Anyways! They make tons of
big TV dramas in Tokyo, right?

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:52.950
--TV dramas?
--TV dramas?

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:56.320
I love 'em! They're so good!

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:59.090
What kind do you watch?

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:03.230
Skyscraper Gangster Story
is the best recently!

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:07.370
I've always been a fan of Hiro-<i>yan</i>,
the main actor!

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.100
I know that one!

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:14.710
That's the one they have public
tapings of in the Media Complex Tower!

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:18.280
--Go check a map.
--Talk about cold-hearted!

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:23.150
I don't know much about Tokyo;
you could at least show me around!

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:43.400
Look! Look! I'm on TV!

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:46.300
OK! Just put that away!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:59.050
98% of Japan's film industry is
located here at J-Wood Movie City.

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:04.610
And at its center is the
Media Complex Tower (MCT).

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:11.330
Well, then. It's time for the drama tour
you've all been waiting for.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:16.270
They're filming the final episode
of Skyscraper Gangster Story now.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:20.330
I watch it every week!
This is gonna be great!

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:30.280
OK, that's good.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:33.410
Huh? Why're they
wearing those clothes?

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:37.920
Though I'm sure some
people may doubt it,

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:43.290
everything from backgrounds to costumes
is done digitally now.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:47.260
Thanks to that, taping can
continue smoothly on schedule

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:50.600
regardless of weather
or location problems.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.170
OK! Let's give it a go!

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:59.370
Let's watch the filming now.
Please remain quiet.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:02.240
Your era's over!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:07.340
Not yet! With you out of the picture,
I'll keep on going!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:12.750
Killing me won't solve anything!
Why not join me instead?

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:16.750
We can fight an even
more powerful enemy together!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.220
Is that all you have to say?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.530
Prepare to die!

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:28.700
You have me totally beat!
Please don't kill me!

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.730
I'll do anything! Just don't kill me...!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.600
<i>He's lying...!</i>

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:37.470
You sound sincere enough...

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:40.810
<i>He's lying, Hiro-yan! He's lying!</i>

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.040
I guess that's that.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.080
<i>Hiro-yan! Look out!</i>

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:53.150
Don't let him fool you!

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.830
If you can't do it, then I will!

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.740
Hurry! Stop her!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:12.880
--Hey! Stop it!
--What're you doing?!

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:17.050
A general visitor on a
drama-taping tour at the MCT

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:23.020
suddenly caused a scene,
which temporarily halted filming.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:26.220
Luckily, no staff were hurt,
and several wild visitors

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:31.090
were seized by security guards
and admitted into a nearby hospital.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.130
In regard to this incident,
the MCT's programming group

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:39.970
announced that all filming tours
will be cancelled for the time being.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:43.470
It's weird for someone to
mistake a drama for reality.

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:46.710
So THAT'S why she swings
that sword around...

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.180
Right, Jo?

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:51.110
There's definitely something
strange about her...

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.520
What is it, Sei?

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.320
"Interference plateau?"

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:06.060
Yes. A phenomenon involving strong
reactions to specific wavelengths.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:11.070
They may be experiencing exterior
stimulation through sensory nerves.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.200
Exterior stimulation? Such as?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.680
I can't say without closer examination,
but whatever it is,

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:22.040
the more sensitive the child,
the stronger the effect.

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:28.350
<i>Something that causes a strong effect</i>...

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:04.320
These are all the
results of our experiments.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:09.390
If humans possess an
even further evolution,

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:14.330
it would most undoubtedly
be within the brain.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:17.370
The body is nothing more
than a tool meant to follow

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:21.200
the development of the brain
and act out orders.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:26.340
Eventually, our bodies will
also reach their limits

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.480
and disappear from this world.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:35.820
However, our thoughts and ideas will
be inherited by the next generation.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:42.360
Since ancient times, humans have
searched for a utopia they dreamed of.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:45.090
We will make it a reality.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:50.870
In this deathtopia known as Tokyo.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.520
Yeah, she's sound asleep.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:11.860
I'll be leaving in a bit, too.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:16.590
I appreciate it. I'll have
someone here help from now on.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.820
Crap!

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:54.560
Damn it!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.120
Understood.

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:16.180
Please leave the rest to us.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.220
Amy!

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:23.730
Got ya! You want me to
track Leo-<i>ojichan</i>'s GPS!

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:27.250
Let's see. The projected
course data is..

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:33.000
Amy's tracking the car right now!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.400
Got it.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:36.200
Meg! We're going back!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.370
But I haven't chosen any yet!

00:11:57.390 --> 00:12:00.020
<i>Hiro-yan! You can't die!</i>

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:08.140
We will transmit the mind control waves
based on these children's data

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:13.710
by hiding them in the EM signals
coming from the MCT.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:19.780
If this experiment succeeds, we can
finally start with the final stage.

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:21.620
Here we are!

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:27.420
You're definitely in the MCT!
I WILL locate you!

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.730
"Infiltration"

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:48.700
"Danger"

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.160
Look out!

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.160
What the...?!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.810
That was close!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:20.710
We'd be pancakes if that hit us!

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:31.720
--Here it comes!
--Get back!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.270
Jo! Look!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.100
"This is a warning."

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:18.900
Fumihiko-<i>chan</i>! Take your cell phone
if you're going out!

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:41.660
<i>This series of events is no coincidence</i>.

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:43.730
<i>Things that look completely unrelated</i>

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.630
<i>can very well be connected
by an unseen thread</i>.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:52.330
<i>That thread's origin is
the Media Complex Tower</i>...

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:56.170
<i>The key to this mystery
should be there!</i>

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.230
Jo! Are you ready?!

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:04.540
--All set!
--See you soon!

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:19.330
This appears to be the Bailan
combat weapon from Maria's report.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:24.770
Perfect. Test to see how well
our experiment works on it.

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:29.530
As the saying goes, "Like a bug
that flies into... something."

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:34.640
I'll go over the plan again!

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:39.720
Connect Django directly to the
main cables beneath the MCT.

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:43.350
If I can relay through Django
and use the amplified circuits,

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:47.150
I can use that to rush in
and strip 'em naked!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:52.800
Whoever sent the warning seems
to be planning something big,

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:55.330
but there's still too little info.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:59.340
Avoid combat as much as possible
until we can ID the enemy.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:03.140
Jo! If things turn bad,
your strength and guts are your best bet!

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:05.370
Right, Meg.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:40.070
I sent camouflage data, so none of
the auto-guard systems will activate!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.780
Bingo!

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.560
At this rate, we might locate
Takane and the others soon!

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:22.390
Why are there kids
all around the trailer?!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.820
What?! Amy!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:27.360
Amy! Do you read me? What's going on?

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:31.660
Is the intrusion into
the MCT going well? Amy?!

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.630
Someone help!

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:48.640
What's happened to everyone?

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:51.710
<i>Is this an interference plateau, too?</i>

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.620
<i>If the special wavelengths
affecting the children</i>

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:57.140
<i>are coming from the MCT</i>...

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.680
<i>Jo's in danger!</i>

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:09.990
What the...?!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:11.090
She continues to fight a
formless enemy in this world.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:14.400
And once her state of
mind reaches its limit,

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:18.130
it will likely cause a self-collapse
ending in termination.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.190
Hey, monster!

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:13.950
You can keep dreaming in hell!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:52.260
Where am I...?

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:55.530
What the heck is going on?

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:59.800
For now, it looks like whatever
was controlling the children is gone.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.510
So did Jo win?!

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.940
Yes. She just might have.

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:13.520
Am I getting old, too...?

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:17.950
Astonishing mental power!

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:23.120
Not even a trained soldier
could hope to reach that level...!

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:28.560
She's a subject worthy of
much of our current attention.

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:32.790
Or an enemy!

00:21:56.160 --> 00:22:03.830
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:11.480
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.480 --> 00:22:19.180
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:28.560
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:35.100
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:44.110
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:50.980
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:17.110
<i>The super high-speed hunting dogs attack,
fangs of revenge bared</i>.

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:19.510
<i>Crush them, Jo!</i>

00:23:19.510 --> 00:23:26.280
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Massacre Highway"
